    },
    {
      heading: "Why Canada-wide matters here",
      body: "A Canadian small business needs a site that works in both official languages and loads fast for customers anywhere in the country. We build in English and French, with CAD pricing, a domain that belongs to the business, and a contact form that turns visits into calls and quote requests.",
    },
    {
      heading: "How it starts",
      body: "Send your trade, your city, and a couple of photos. We reply with two demo directions and an honest timeline. Demo directions are chosen from the 47-demo catalog as a style direction only. Client sites are custom builds, never template clones.",
