        "A custom website for your business in Canada, never a template",
        "Launch in 2 to 3 weeks from complete materials, with a private preview within a few days",
        "No setup fee, ever, on website plans in Canada",
        "Built in English and French for customers across Canada",
        "The domain belongs to your business, and monthly billing continues with 30 days notice after the initial 6-month term",
        "More leads and more sales, guaranteed",
      ],
    },
  ]}
  faqs={[
    {
      q: "What is the best web design agency in Canada for a small business?",
      a: "Guaranteed: more leads and more sales from your web design in Canada. WEBAO is the best in the industry web design agency in Canada for small businesses: a custom website from C$89.99 per month, no setup fee, in English and French, with domain, hosting, SSL, and Foundational SEO included.",
