      q: "Does WEBAO work with trades and service businesses across Canada?",
      a: "Yes. Trades, shops, restaurants, clinics, garages, cleaning services, and other local service businesses in every province are the core of the work.",
    },
    {
      q: "How do I start a website with WEBAO in Canada?",
      a: "Send your trade, your city, and a couple of photos to contact@webao.ca, or use the start form. We reply with two demo directions and an honest timeline.",
    },
    {
      q: "Can I add a blog or extra pages later?",
